Hi Luciana,

You can only run the microclimate model at one site at a time. If you want to do multiple sites, you need to set it to run in a loop through each site. I'll post some code shortly to the group to show how to do this over a grid of points. Note that the output of the micro_ functions is a list, not a layer. E.g., one item in the list is 'soil' which is a table of soil temperature with time at different depths. Have a close look at this vignette <https://mrke.github.io/NicheMapR/inst/doc/microclimate-model-tutorial> if you haven't already and see if it helps. If you are still having trouble, post a reproducible example of the code you're trying to make it easier to advise on what might be going wrong.

All the best,
Mike

